* Called for deep cuts to Medicaid and Medicare;
* Nearly caused a government default in 2011;
* Blocked gun-control legislation;
* Blocked minimum wage increases;
* Overused and abused the filibuster by his party
* Refused a vote for the SCOTUS nomination of Merrick Garland;
* Supported Donald Trump in the 2016 election;
* Forced through the Nomination of ultra-conservative Supreme Court Justice Neil Gorsuch;
* Forced through the nomination of Brett Kavanaugh;
* Forced through the SCOTUS nomination of Amy Coney Barrett less than two months before the 2020 election;
* Pushed through the disastrous Trump tax cuts in 2017;
* Coordinated with the Trump White House during the first Trump impeachment;
* Refused to acknowledge Joe Biden's presidential win until _December,_ 2020;
* Voted to acquit Trump in the second Impeachment trial; and
* Pledged to vote for Trump _again_ in 2024 if he got the chance.

